#: scenario2:scenario2_688A4793_C7AA_462A_9611_F83DFB13851F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 605e14a7198ff6fd847d9e8ccaafad31c45646ffb5a872708292ef5e7e590aab
#. default-sha256: c5ed6b2a47d87876fa3bf802d0ef7c9b84171173ba6943080c36b653024a18c4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_688A4793_C7AA_462A_9611_F83DFB13851F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Several days passed by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫下仆和巴斯蒂亚的生活又过了一段"
"时间。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5A9D3DC6_28F0_486B_93BA_C817C90E1C9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22efaa1418aa1a591d6e82f52051ad89723695cd84c0b9370c94139491787742
#. default-sha256: 2767b69222ab7cc089f3bc32749bf5b4f6e832529964413d3bb83110701fbf63
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5A9D3DC6_28F0_486B_93BA_C817C90E1C9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As Bestia began to act more like a person, the mansion followed suit, slowly becoming more "
"habitable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though not yet back to its former glory."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫巴斯蒂亚变得有人性之后，⟪k:1⟫馆也渐渐地恢复了曾经的辉煌……⟪k:2⟫变得可以住人了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ACFE5913_A744_4DEE_B2EA_51398CC5D283
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 662034e91d9e6029b7e3b13d8c1bf6010c697b4d9a9ab7f3548cbb31c1220b86
#. default-sha256: aad7cf0fb453f17c9a0ec23691d25d04307777e7f2f2f585ef2bbeaaa1ff043b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ACFE5913_A744_4DEE_B2EA_51398CC5D283"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No flowers grew in the garden, but neither were there weeds infesting it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然庭院里还是连一朵花也没有，⟪k:1⟫但是杂草不见了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B1167F3A_75E6_4D6A_9C89_AE907DFA03DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e42c5465978d05163f136d1baad1ab8c667f6b7f74b54227d13067f63c355d8b
#. default-sha256: a5d2c9b3b47c4bcf05355e877155aff7755814219e1f27b744cd5f4675cf22ca
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B1167F3A_75E6_4D6A_9C89_AE907DFA03DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The dusty corridors, shattered windows, rust-covered kitchen gradually returned to their "
"proper states."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫曾经满是灰尘的走廊，⟪k:1⟫残破不堪的窗户，⟪k:2⟫锈迹斑斑的厨房，⟪k:3⟫都在渐渐恢复原样。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CF333379_324E_411C_8BA8_4A1292D3806C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0765ec39fc1aed46661ca604fb3ac696420096fba9a66f3c3ceddae21c31c23
#. default-sha256: f6abdeba101ca461c86e331cb7d6abb50338c818e1c47dc243f1174b0e65c7a5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CF333379_324E_411C_8BA8_4A1292D3806C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia learned how to change his own clothes, and how to draw a bath."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他学会了穿衣洗澡。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D5BA30A1_9184_4D30_8872_75DAB8B5F415
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 430194ad47d9986b4d79e11f42b58a3d1918e913aac28cca737564db41fa7013
#. default-sha256: 56bab268d0563c774d8b27cbf3d27555f985adf4c60fa54105507e5ee9af99ba
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D5BA30A1_9184_4D30_8872_75DAB8B5F415"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No longer did I have to wait on him hand and foot; he could take care of a number of things "
"all by himself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不用下仆手把手地指导，⟪k:1⟫他也可以做许多事了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D79B220E_57C9_4DED_A57C_2075A463BBEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb4a6ba8caae56c681060bed801c9de22fb82cfd9eedc42b9e080fe1fcfcb45c
#. default-sha256: 13f165544a53e624efaf4e90ed6086e090746dfbe65527baff9376588106eae1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D79B220E_57C9_4DED_A57C_2075A463BBEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What we lacked for food, he acquired from the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果食材不够了，⟪k:1⟫他去森林里寻找食物。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7D2B203C_1FCD_46CD_A028_6F38D55124CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d719a634bdcb312bf2f6bc32320190b07ab239443b9a9a74df2772d074b3c4a3
#. default-sha256: fd2adc06dcce1966b9759dcc2b748e0924c84ecc3db001f9ace2fd49c13e1c8d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7D2B203C_1FCD_46CD_A028_6F38D55124CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Never did he go to purchase supplies from the village; rather, he captured hares and "
"gathered herbs hidden in the overgrowth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他绝不到村里或小镇上买东西，⟪k:1⟫只是抓一些从草丛里露出头的野兔，⟪k:2⟫采一些混在杂草中的野"
"菜。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4A1DA3C5_BFC4_4B16_8A65_3C6D191A453C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2a4b52b2a503cb6c2518eb9ba52c89a912d2f031aa6e8473ac83ab0c11c36c5
#. default-sha256: ac5bdbff3997e2afe42cad8cfd943137c6c36bcdfba70530b12fc056c680662a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4A1DA3C5_BFC4_4B16_8A65_3C6D191A453C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They were days without incident."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这是一段一成不变的日子。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_498053BB_5921_4AC8_8CEE_B4D7B6C92591
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b687656e7efccd82e6dee3b297fa78500867c510a9e2ae1646c60bc6e5e7b8b
#. default-sha256: 7f03528d7ad7ce725635eae0c2ca921df84dd4fe3cc9ad827095e93649099826
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_498053BB_5921_4AC8_8CEE_B4D7B6C92591"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And though such a life may be want for excitement,⟪k:1⟫peace is something that you mustn’t "
"take for granted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然一成不变……⟪k:1⟫但这才是难得的平静生活。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D3B91922_7A77_4BCF_8186_25A36F31B2A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbbc4805fb6b8f14bbb2626ae0d8949c91b9e2579debf24a3d5dc4e758c11e1b
#. default-sha256: 4a97d6a4623cdec92fc36a931fb619bcf3f96b98d006f70b298c2f509985d451
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D3B91922_7A77_4BCF_8186_25A36F31B2A8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those who have it cast it aside, finding the leisurely flow of time dull.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Only "
"those who have never experienced it truly know how precious it is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫对一开始就拥有这种生活的人来说，⟪k:1⟫平静的生活早已司空见惯、平淡乏味。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫而只有在苦难"
"环境中生活过的人，⟪k:4⟫才知道它的珍贵。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_182E1A71_E6E2_42FE_8B96_352D86C0011C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff9f60ab62d24a88b5d1d897ec9c187c7c70ecda9f1d0b24a109463e0331d560
#. default-sha256: c9d95362784ad7a1ecbaee74a04dc221aa516ed887121b63c21c82e06f13cfb2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_182E1A71_E6E2_42FE_8B96_352D86C0011C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia appeared to be content.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He wore an expression of solitary serenity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫巴斯蒂亚看起来很满足。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫因为他脸上洋溢着寂寞而幸福的笑容。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ABF7C6D5_59BA_4D62_B4E5_B76C6FDAE414
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6efd995c921b775364af4d83b740fd44bd8bb30bcc4571253e713a4f91c7680
#. default-sha256: dd28e7951834c9d3287357216e20d73b84e23bbdd5f93a1ef87013f5f9617d20
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ABF7C6D5_59BA_4D62_B4E5_B76C6FDAE414"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Is anyone there?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫有人、⟪k:2⟫有人在吗！"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D8049308_610B_4CC1_946D_875B4B2BC5C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c5394b9fcde94b32c43e3d7bab5b1188f619772238df2bea1e7d4d0d7567e81
#. default-sha256: 75f4fe727371795fb2dd5fe1c26dcd352a0dc89d638557a54f78d52d01df49e5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D8049308_610B_4CC1_946D_875B4B2BC5C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then one day, a crack formed in the uneventful tranquility."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫敲门声打破了平静的日子。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BDA3B870_0269_45BA_B4DC_4E13089C6B6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7305718c8ab9fa95b396a9ce5a1989b93a3bca0e5062c9a281686847a3e4f061
#. default-sha256: 2a8798a150fccc9ff5392ca40c8b5a665d561ef05b009fac9a048712227404f4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BDA3B870_0269_45BA_B4DC_4E13089C6B6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Is anyone... ⟪k:1⟫in there?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Could you part with some food?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I don’t need "
"much..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫有人……在吗？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫只要一点就够了，⟪k:3⟫可以给我点食物吗？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_33F944EF_4505_43BF_B4AF_F877BE36926E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5408f5944d4838b3d7a1058e6e66d546474ddc5a3784e47107ca75757abcd6d
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33F944EF_4505_43BF_B4AF_F877BE36926E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CAD05A95_0B56_410E_BC7C_F06F9807B5D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7edd50ed2e5817daaf283d1368e4f5eecdc640b86c630a97f9873a5fdc16202
#. default-sha256: 448787c079a5ab41f1f8eff037bb3356cc28e36b7133a74608d38595ef7120eb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CAD05A95_0B56_410E_BC7C_F06F9807B5D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Some food and water...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Just a little... ⟪k:4⟫that’s all I need."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫一点……⟪k:2⟫只要一点就可以了，⟪k:3⟫请给我水和食物……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_EE3A043A_8F3C_453F_98D4_DF29A893202B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40cf044b039982fbb29dc15b1daf3989b759adf531497bf2dfccb839d1b0734d
#. default-sha256: 083a76fac9c67e5d89ca301237b6a5558c917f35faf45c3c71b6dd328a69c075
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EE3A043A_8F3C_453F_98D4_DF29A893202B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia looked over at me, as if seeking my aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫巴斯蒂亚向下仆投来了求助的目光。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E65CAEF0_5F18_4805_8B03_1F48719B3E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80d731e5257a37ddb4a7114c2513f69e6d8f176f0a9281fedb9f96d4353f362e
#. default-sha256: d8880cfc9c4080342f199f408607f84699ef48a08f9add96d67ac34999c10dbf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E65CAEF0_5F18_4805_8B03_1F48719B3E39"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ironic, no? It was the visitor who was truly in need of aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫很奇怪吧？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫应该求救的明明是那位来访者呀。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D5B67BE0_04FF_4A18_A5C4_57489152C1D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d44a9512081eab4bbc721ea69b8ef47d60ff8f2542eafcba76976a5dd402fe4
#. default-sha256: 94ad7829549ee80d00ed1791c108c9bdb937b48ba442dd170f3934019916fa73
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D5B67BE0_04FF_4A18_A5C4_57489152C1D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I pondered it for a few moments, deciding that I could not simply turn away someone calling "
"upon the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆稍微考虑了一下，⟪k:1⟫还是觉得不能怠慢访问馆的客人。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3568FBEE_CF43_4B9F_9C82_B064DA91EB44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88267402ec7a4309ff7b624ea2f7ab8e1a662b5c3a79247323b4f2183d65e4c8
#. default-sha256: 2c0e6f066a6d3434aae50506a2164351dd722d495f4763c9b1753de30f15d23f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3568FBEE_CF43_4B9F_9C82_B064DA91EB44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had Bestia ordered me to not let him in, I would have followed his instructions, but he said "
"nothing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫巴斯蒂亚如果不让下仆招待的话，⟪k:1⟫下仆会遵从的，⟪k:2⟫但是他没有这么说。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_904ED7C5_5FA3_4C11_A82D_51289CA1420B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 034f312ab752fbe675d6ed2cd1cd9cf3913efa69f99526cbe2f0fd25c150e184
#. default-sha256: eddd37d3d8404f15fb4b3987477fd0a6174996bc00fb45ed50c97f4a2a4da880
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_904ED7C5_5FA3_4C11_A82D_51289CA1420B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, thank God... ⟪k:9⟫someone’s here.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I "
"was afraid it was deserted..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫啊，⟪k:9⟫太好了……⟪k:10⟫有人在啊。⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫我以为肯"
"定没人呢。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_33C84E7E_AB3E_40AA_8E38_00C77DB2E306
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5dcdf4771373d38aaa5238d51dfeca4b90b14807ffde973fba71cf59a9c1701
#. default-sha256: ad863ffb6dd45f4ea1dd06b29c6adc05db3153c3ea486823bf19ca98b084e9c9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33C84E7E_AB3E_40AA_8E38_00C77DB2E306"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You said you were in need of sustenance?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫您想要食物吧。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_25162922_AE76_445C_BB3B_A26C45CE57B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ddd407a14250b2829694d87d18e25962137e6e3b2bfec5a26c9ded1f079ab17
#. default-sha256: 6602c2d09d356058e57a5c57faf44cb4fa3ac48a85bde4f89361d7a90ce145db
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25162922_AE76_445C_BB3B_A26C45CE57B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Y-⟪k:1⟫Yes...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It doesn’t have to be much.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Anything to quench this thirst..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫嗯，⟪k:1⟫是的。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫只要一点点就可以了。⟪k:4⟫只要是充饥的东西，⟪k:5⟫什么都行。 "

#: scenario2:scenario2_4147CBC7_826A_4542_ACEC_32037E2B24DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef7ecbfea7b3e4a223c0c69c7a895e3cd1a75da9d6d17801c8b2f2628ba101a1
#. default-sha256: 96bdf5bb4a4f449c25627875c34f5ee410a0e73edfc2458d540bee242ca2ae5c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4147CBC7_826A_4542_ACEC_32037E2B24DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I got lost, and it’s been several days..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我迷路……⟪k:1⟫已经好几天了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_F9CF7669_9227_4694_914C_94455E2A07A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1933ec27eb7ead9e5fd8c413a6d2f33c64f609db2c5ff7996dccdd93c1d8d1ac
#. default-sha256: 949076e2e6266bba347fbe9fc864fa6dc545ec7936198ede092100de1e914f50
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F9CF7669_9227_4694_914C_94455E2A07A0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Give me a few minutes, I will find—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫您稍等一下。⟪k:1⟫ 下仆去拿些吃的东西——"

#: scenario2:scenario2_AC9BD4EF_8269_46C5_995F_F13494636F77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
